 and adolescents aged 5–14 years, from 14.7 to 4.4 for adolescents and young adults aged 15–19 years, and from 14.1 to 6.9 for young adults aged 20–24 years. For most of the period, rates were highest for persons aged 20–24 years followed by those aged 15–19, 0–4, and 5–14 years.","hasAlt":true,"isDecorative":false,"isMissingAlt":false,"ariaHidden":false,"rolePresentation":false,"renderedWidth":700,"renderedHeight":381,"naturalWidth":700,"naturalHeight":381,"loading":null,"decoding":"async","altVerdict":"TOO_LONG","altReason":"alt text is 779 characters — consider a caption or description","bytes":15587},{"src":"https://www.cdc.gov/TemplatePackage/5.0/img/logo/cdc-logo-tag-right.svg","alt":"Centers for Disease Control and Prevention","hasAlt":true,"isDecorative":false,"isMissingAlt":false,"ariaHidden":false,"rolePresentation":false,"renderedWidth":283,"renderedHeight":66,"naturalWidth":827,"naturalHeight":193,"loading":null,"decoding":null,"altVerdict":"GOOD","altReason":"present, no red flags","bytes":4780},{"src":"https://www.cdc.gov/TemplatePackage/contrib/libs/cdc/c2r/crlogo.svg","alt":"Content Credentials logo","hasAlt":true,"isDecorative":false,"isMissingAlt":false,"ariaHidden":false,"rolePresentation":false,"renderedWidth":25,"renderedHeight":150,"naturalWidth":150,"naturalHeight":150,"loading":null,"decoding":null,"altVerdict":"GOOD","altReason":"present, no red flags","bytes":1490}]},"standards":{"engine":"standards","checks":[{"id":"schema-gov","label":"schema.org GovernmentOrganization markup","pass":false,"detail":""},{"id":"canonical","label":"Canonical URL declared","pass":true,"detail":""},{"id":"hreflang","label":"hreflang alternates declared","pass":false,"detail":""},{"id":"title","label":"Page has a <title>","pass":true,"detail":""},{"id":"description","label":"Meta description present","pass":true,"detail":""},{"id":"charset","label":"Character encoding declared","pass":true,"detail":""},{"id":"lang","label":"Document language (lang) set","pass":